      label: Day 25% close then session +10%
      notify: Day-25-boost
      symbol: "*"
      enabled: true
      once_per_session: true
      cooldown_minutes: 240
      confirm_delay_minutes: 10
      confirm_value: 0
      condition:
        type: afterhours_gain
        value: 10
        min_recent_day_change: 25
        recent_day_count: 1
        intraday_touch: false
        min_market_cap: 1000000
        max_market_cap: 1000000000
        min_volume: 10000
      slack_message: "{stock_name}{field_gap}{move_text}{price_text}"

    - id: afterhours-halt-or-5d-boost
      name: 熔断或5日涨超50%后续超10%或曾涨超100%后续超5%的股票
      description: 今日盘中一度涨超50%或过去5个交易日（不含今天）曾收盘涨超50%且盘后超10%；今日盘中一度涨超100%、涨停或过去5日曾收盘涨超100%且盘后超5%；成交量超过1万，总市值超过100万美元且不超过10亿美元；达标即提醒
